    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Kimi25 Snark declined to cast Shoot the Sheriff on Oblivious Bookworm before combat. Oblivious Bookworm is a non-outlaw creature (Human Wizard), so it's a valid target. By not killing it, Kimi25 took 2 combat damage and the opponent will get card advantage from Bookworm's end step trigger. Shoot the Sheriff costs only 1B, which Kimi25 can pay with Watery Grave + Island or Fountainport. Removing Bookworm before it attacks and before it generates card advantage at end of turn is clearly the right play.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to cast Shoot the Sheriff or any spell before combat, allowing Oblivious Bookworm to attack for 2 damage.",
      "better_line": "Cast Shoot the Sheriff targeting Oblivious Bookworm before combat to prevent 2 damage and deny the opponent's end-step card draw trigger.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 67,
      "player": "Kimi25 Snark",
      "decision_index": 2,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Enduring Curiosity (which has Flash) during postcombat main phase taps out completely, losing the ability to hold up Shoot the Sheriff or Tishana's Tidebinder during the opponent's turn. Notably, Tishana's Tidebinder could counter Oblivious Bookworm's end step draw trigger.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Enduring Curiosity in postcombat main, tapping out",
      "better_line": "Pass the turn holding up mana, potentially cast Tishana's Tidebinder to counter Bookworm's end step trigger, or flash in Enduring Curiosity at end of opponent's turn if nothing needs answering",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 85,
      "player": "Kimi25 Snark",
      "decision_index": 4,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Chose to copy Wistfulness with Superior Spider-Man, but Wistfulness's ETB abilities require {G}{G} or {U}{U} to have been spent casting it. Since Superior Spider-Man costs {2}{U}{B}, neither condition is met, so the copy gains no relevant abilities beyond being a 4/4 body. Meanwhile, copying Oblivious Bookworm would have granted a repeatable end-step card draw ability, which is significant ongoing value when the player only has 2 cards in hand and is facing two Enduring Curiosities.",
      "action_taken": "Chose Wistfulness as the copy target for Superior Spider-Man's Mind Swap ability.",
      "better_line": "Choose Oblivious Bookworm to gain the repeatable end-step draw ability on a 4/4 body, providing much-needed card advantage.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 132,
      "player": "Llama4 Sarge",
      "decision_index": 7,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "At 2 life facing an opponent at 16 with Enduring Curiosity on board, copying Oblivious Bookworm gives a vanilla 4/4 ground creature with minor card draw upside. Deep-Cavern Bat would give a 4/4 with flying and lifelink (critical at 2 life for survival and racing) plus hand disruption on ETB to potentially exile a key spell like Shoot the Sheriff or Bitter Triumph.",
      "action_taken": "Copied Oblivious Bookworm, getting a 4/4 with end-step draw/discard",
      "better_line": "Copy Deep-Cavern Bat to get a 4/4 flying lifelinker that can stabilize life total and disrupt opponent's hand, which is far more impactful at 2 life",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 212,
      "player": "Llama4 Sarge",
      "decision_index": 12,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Failed to cast any spell during combat despite having castable options. With Watery Grave, Gloomlake Verge, and Fountainport untapped, Shoot the Sheriff could target Superior Spider-Man (4/4) for {1}{B}, or Floodpits Drowner could tap an attacker. Instead, the attempted cast failed due to mana payment issues, resulting in taking 6 damage instead of potentially only 2.",
      "action_taken": "Attempted to cast a spell but failed mana payment, resulting in no action taken and taking full 6 combat damage.",
      "better_line": "Cast Shoot the Sheriff targeting Superior Spider-Man (4/4) using Watery Grave for {B} and Gloomlake Verge or Fountainport for {1}, reducing incoming damage by 4.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 307,
      "player": "Kimi25 Snark",
      "decision_index": 24,
    }
  ],
